Kanye West: The rapper changes his name to Ye
Rapper Kanye West is going to change his name to Ye.
He tweeted: "The creature previously known as Kanye West."
West, 41, has been dubbed Ye for some time and used the name as the title of his eighth album released in June.
The change comes for his participation in the Saturday Night Live episode where he is expected to announce his new album, Yandhi.
He replaces Ariana Grandi on the show, but she canceled for "emotional reasons," the show's executive producer said.
